    ! #237: "Add a ticket-header primary control that executes the first actionable `SuggestedNextSteps` entry" - The first actionable step is the primary control when one exists, but it does not always execute directly: an assignment step opens an agent picker. If no step is actionable, it falls back to a caption.
    ! #218: "Require `AgentLoop` to invoke `check_grounding` through `tool_choice` once after retrieval supplies passages" - The loop forces a check only if passages have been retrieved and no check has run. A model-initiated check satisfies the condition, so `AgentLoop` does not always force one through `tool_choice`.
