    ! #223: "The assistant no longer claims a ticket change succeeded unless a tool reports success in the conversation." - The PR added this rule to the system prompt, but does not establish that the assistant will always follow it. The original behavior was not reproducible in the live turns tested before the change.
    ! #223: "When you have already requested a change, it proceeds without asking you to confirm again" - The PR added a no-needless-confirmation rule to the prompt and verified a specific live scenario. It does not establish that the assistant consistently proceeds without asking across requests.

